{
    "title": "Everand: Ebooks and audiobooks",
    "description": "Everand is a reading subscription with millions of ebooks, audiobooks, magazines, podcasts, and sheet music. Starting at $11.99/month, read what you want, how you want \u2014 across devices and offline.\r\n\r\nListen to millions of popular and exclusive audiobooks and ebooks, including The New York Times\u00ae Best Sellers, from every genre:\r\n\r\n    * True Crime\r\n    * Fiction\r\n    * Personal Growth\r\n    * Science Fiction\r\n    * Biography\r\n    * Health and Wellness\r\n    * Personal Growth\r\n    * Children\r\n    * Cookbooks\r\n    * Entertainment\r\n    * Travel\r\n    * Celebrity Narrated Memoirs\r\n    * Religion and Spirituality\r\n    * YA\r\n    * Self-Help\r\n    * Romance\r\n    * Business\r\n    * Politics\r\n    * Current Events\r\n\r\nEVERAND SUBSCRIPTIONS\r\n\r\nEverand is a flexible digital reading subscription that gives you instant access to millions of bestselling ebooks, audiobooks, and more. Choose between two monthly plans and enjoy exclusive savings on titles you love as an Everand member.\r\n\r\nEnjoy free for 30 days, cancel anytime. \r\n\r\nPLUS PLAN\r\n\r\n    * $16.99/month \r\n    * Billed monthly after trial \r\n    * Unlock 3 titles per month from our catalog of 1.5M bestsellers and new releases\r\n\r\nSTANDARD PLAN\r\n\r\n    * $11.99/month \r\n    * Billed monthly after trial \r\n    * Unlock 1 title per month from our catalog of 1.5M bestsellers and new releases\r\n\r\nBOTH SUBSCRIPTIONS INCLUDE\r\n\r\n    * Keep and read your unlocked titles for the duration of your subscription\r\n    * Unlimited access to a select catalog of 20k+ additional pieces of content, including Everand Originals, podcasts, magazines, and sheet music\r\n    * Personalized recommendations to help you find a new favorite\r\n    * Read or listen online or offline\r\n    * Enjoy on web, iOS, Android, Apple Watch, Carplay (Apple), and Android Auto\r\n    * Complimentary access to Scribd and SlideShare: 170M+ documents and presentations\r\n    * Upgrade, downgrade, or cancel at any time\r\n\r\nListen or read to all titles on Everand on multiple devices and even offline. And \u2013 enjoy these special features included in your subscription at no extra cost.\r\n\r\nAUDIOBOOK FEATURES\r\n\r\n    * Customize your narration speed\r\n    * Set a sleep timer\r\n    * Download audiobooks to listen offline\r\n\r\nEBOOK FEATURES\r\n\r\n    * Download ebooks to read offline\r\n    * Make notes and annotations, and add bookmarks\r\n    * Customize your font size, type, and background color\r\n    * Choose horizontal or vertical page scrolling\r\n-\r\n\r\nOur monthly subscription automatically renews unless the subscription is canceled at least 24 hours prior to the next billing date.\r\n\r\n    * Payment will be charged to your Google Play account at confirmation of purchase.\r\n    * Subscriptions may be managed by the user and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the user's Account Settings after purchase.\r\n    * A subscription includes access to Everand, Scribd, and SlideShare through one monthly payment based on your plan.\r\n\r\nDownload the free Everand app and start listening and reading today!\r\n\r\nOur privacy policy can be found at https://www.scribd.com/privacy\r\nOur terms of use can be found at  https://www.scribd.com/terms",
    "descriptionHTML": "Everand is a reading subscription with millions of ebooks, audiobooks, magazines, podcasts, and sheet music. Starting at $11.99/month, read what you want, how you want \u2014 across devices and offline.<br><br>Listen to millions of popular and exclusive audiobooks and ebooks, including The New York Times\u00ae Best Sellers, from every genre:<br><br>    * True Crime<br>    * Fiction<br>    * Personal Growth<br>    * Science Fiction<br>    * Biography<br>    * Health and Wellness<br>    * Personal Growth<br>    * Children<br>    * Cookbooks<br>    * Entertainment<br>    * Travel<br>    * Celebrity Narrated Memoirs<br>    * Religion and Spirituality<br>    * YA<br>    * Self-Help<br>    * Romance<br>    * Business<br>    * Politics<br>    * Current Events<br><br>EVERAND SUBSCRIPTIONS<br><br>Everand is a flexible digital reading subscription that gives you instant access to millions of bestselling ebooks, audiobooks, and more. Choose between two monthly plans and enjoy exclusive savings on titles you love as an Everand member.<br><br>Enjoy free for 30 days, cancel anytime. <br><br>PLUS PLAN<br><br>    * $16.99/month <br>    * Billed monthly after trial <br>    * Unlock 3 titles per month from our catalog of 1.5M bestsellers and new releases<br><br>STANDARD PLAN<br><br>    * $11.99/month <br>    * Billed monthly after trial <br>    * Unlock 1 title per month from our catalog of 1.5M bestsellers and new releases<br><br>BOTH SUBSCRIPTIONS INCLUDE<br><br>    * Keep and read your unlocked titles for the duration of your subscription<br>    * Unlimited access to a select catalog of 20k+ additional pieces of content, including Everand Originals, podcasts, magazines, and sheet music<br>    * Personalized recommendations to help you find a new favorite<br>    * Read or listen online or offline<br>    * Enjoy on web, iOS, Android, Apple Watch, Carplay (Apple), and Android Auto<br>    * Complimentary access to Scribd and SlideShare: 170M+ documents and presentations<br>    * Upgrade, downgrade, or cancel at any time<br><br>Listen or read to all titles on Everand on multiple devices and even offline. And \u2013 enjoy these special features included in your subscription at no extra cost.<br><br>AUDIOBOOK FEATURES<br><br>    * Customize your narration speed<br>    * Set a sleep timer<br>    * Download audiobooks to listen offline<br><br>EBOOK FEATURES<br><br>    * Download ebooks to read offline<br>    * Make notes and annotations, and add bookmarks<br>    * Customize your font size, type, and background color<br>    * Choose horizontal or vertical page scrolling<br>-<br><br>Our monthly subscription automatically renews unless the subscription is canceled at least 24 hours prior to the next billing date.<br><br>    * Payment will be charged to your Google Play account at confirmation of purchase.<br>    * Subscriptions may be managed by the user and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the user&#39;s Account Settings after purchase.<br>    * A subscription includes access to Everand, Scribd, and SlideShare through one monthly payment based on your plan.<br><br>Download the free Everand app and start listening and reading today!<br><br>Our privacy policy can be found at https://www.scribd.com/privacy<br>Our terms of use can be found at  https://www.scribd.com/terms",
